OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA wet
OL,6,Fevening to come, with the rain heavy
OL,7,Fand persistent for a time, especially
OL,8,Fover higher ground. Turning drier
OL,9,Fovernight with some clear spells
OL,10,Fdeveloping and winds also easing.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FA day of sunshine and
OL,13,Fshowers, with the showers turning
OL,14,Fheavy and thundery in places. Winds
OL,15,Falso freshening once again helping to
OL,16,Fgive a rather cool feel to the day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
